            "title": "IonQ Stock Heads for a Record High. This Acquisition Got Clearance.",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Shares of  IonQ  surged Friday after the quantum-computing company said the UK Investment Security Unit had cleared its acquisition of Oxford Ionics, a British start-up.  The companies in June said they entered into a definitive agreement for  IonQ  to acquire Oxford Ionics for $1.075 billion, in a transaction consisting of $1.065 billion in IonQ shares plus $10 million in cash.  Speaking at the company\u2019s investor day on Friday, CEO Niccolo de Masi said IonQ was the \u201cbest-capitalized company\u201d in the sector.",
